      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَأْكِيمٌ</span></b>  The <i>being big in the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَفَل</span> [i. e. the
<i>hinder parts,</i> or <i>posteriors,</i> also termed <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَأْكَمَةٌ</span>].
(O, K.) You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَكَّمَتِ المَرْأَةٌ</span> <i>The woman was
large in the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَفَل</span>. (TK.)

